{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Samitigutta","html":"<article id='thag1.81'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.81 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.81 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Navamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Nine </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Samitiguttattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Samitigutta </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yaṁ mayā pakataṁ pāpaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Any bad things I’ve done </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>pubbe aññāsu jātisu; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in previous lives, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Idheva taṁ vedanīyaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>are to be experienced right here, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vatthu aññaṁ na vijjatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>not in any other place. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Samitigutto thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
